[
    [
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "望海潮 <sup>a</sup>"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 1
            },
            "bbox": [
                337,
                117,
                470,
                149
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "柳 永"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                369,
                167,
                436,
                186
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "东南形胜<sup>b</sup>，三吴<sup>c</sup> 都会，钱塘<sup>d</sup> 自古繁华。烟柳画桥<sup>e</sup>，风帘 翠幕<sup>f</sup>，参差十万人家。云树<sup>g</sup> 绕堤沙，怒涛卷霜雪<sup>h</sup>，天堑<sup>i</sup> 无 涯。市列珠玑<sup>j</sup>，户盈罗绮<sup>k</sup>，竞豪奢。 重湖<sup>l</sup> 叠 清嘉，有 三秋<sup>m</sup> 桂子<sup>n</sup>，十里荷花。羌管弄晴，菱歌泛夜<sup>o</sup>，嬉嬉<sup>p</sup> 钓叟莲 娃<sup>q</sup>。千骑拥高牙<sup>r</sup>，乘醉听箫鼓，吟赏烟霞<sup>s</sup>。异日图将<sup>t</sup> 好景， 归去凤池夸 <sup>u</sup>。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                105,
                210,
                702,
                346
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "image",
            "content": {
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/1a7724cfe96041d8ad465bbf621cd635d54673db43a3e34fd08ba481a1a4128b.jpg"
                },
                "image_caption": [],
                "image_footnote": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "钱塘秋潮图（局部） ［南宋］佚名 作"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                109,
                354,
                899,
                583
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "a 选自《乐章集校注》中编（中华书局2015年版）。望海潮，词牌名。这首词为赠两浙转运使孙何之作。柳永（约987—约1053），字耆卿，原名三变，崇安（今属福建）人，北宋词人。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                105,
                659,
                478,
                724
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "b〔形胜〕地理形势优越。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                105,
                724,
                292,
                739
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "c〔三吴〕指吴兴（今浙江湖州）、吴郡（今江苏苏州）、会稽（今浙江绍兴）。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                105,
                739,
                478,
                771
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "d〔钱塘〕今浙江杭州，旧属吴郡。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                105,
                771,
                354,
                788
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "e〔烟柳画桥〕如烟的柳树，雕饰华丽的桥。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                105,
                788,
                415,
                803
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "f〔风帘翠幕〕遮挡门窗的帘子与青绿色的帷幕。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                105,
                803,
                443,
                820
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "g〔云树〕高耸入云的树木。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                105,
                820,
                307,
                835
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "h〔怒涛卷霜雪〕指汹涌的波涛卷起如霜似雪的白色浪花。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                105,
                835,
                478,
                868
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "i〔天堑〕天然壕沟。这里指钱塘江。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                105,
                868,
                368,
                884
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "j〔珠玑〕珠宝。玑，不圆的珠。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                105,
                884,
                337,
                901
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "k〔罗绮〕绫罗绸缎。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                529,
                658,
                687,
                675
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "l〔重湖〕指西湖，分里湖、外湖。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                529,
                675,
                778,
                692
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "m〔三秋〕指农历九月。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                531,
                692,
                704,
                708
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "n〔桂子〕桂花。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                531,
                708,
                658,
                724
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "o〔羌管弄晴，菱歌泛夜〕羌笛在晴空下吹奏，采菱的歌声在夜空中飘荡。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                531,
                724,
                904,
                755
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "p〔嬉嬉〕戏乐的样子。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                531,
                756,
                704,
                771
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "q〔莲娃〕采莲女。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                531,
                772,
                672,
                788
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "r〔高牙〕牙旗，将军之旗。这里借指孙何。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                531,
                788,
                848,
                804
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "s〔吟赏烟霞〕指吟咏欣赏山水景色。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                531,
                804,
                794,
                820
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "t〔图将〕描绘。将，助词，用于动词之后，无实义。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                531,
                820,
                900,
                835
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "u〔归去凤池夸〕意思是，回到朝廷，夸耀杭州的美景。这是委婉称扬孙何因政绩卓著，将入朝执政。凤池，即凤凰池，原指禁苑中的池沼，代指最高行政机关中书省。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                531,
                835,
                902,
                901
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_number",
            "content": {
                "page_number_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "4"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                107,
                70,
                139,
                98
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footer",
            "content": {
                "page_footer_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "第一单元"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                796,
                939,
                862,
                953
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_number",
            "content": {
                "page_number_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "17"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                877,
                940,
                900,
                953
            ]
        }
    ],
    [
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "扬州慢 <sup>a</sup>"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 1
            },
            "bbox": [
                529,
                118,
                658,
                151
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "姜 夔"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                559,
                167,
                628,
                187
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "淳熙丙申至日<sup>b</sup>，予过维扬<sup>c</sup>。夜雪初霁<sup>d</sup>，荠麦<sup>e</sup> 弥望。 入其城则四顾萧条，寒水自碧。暮色渐起，戍角<sup>f</sup> 悲吟。予 怀怆然，感慨今昔，因自度<sup>g</sup> 此曲。千岩老人<sup>h</sup> 以为有黍离 之悲 <sup>i</sup> 也。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                336,
                211,
                890,
                302
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "image",
            "content": {
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/fa9256fb452d0eed3339631e073983a13fb6c348c580e2a9cc965ffa7842cbdc.jpg"
                },
                "image_caption": [],
                "image_footnote": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "淮扬洁秋图（局部） ［清］石涛 作"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                97,
                317,
                887,
                690
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "f〔戍角〕指驻防部队的号角。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                517,
                755,
                734,
                771
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "g〔度〕谱写，作曲。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                519,
                771,
                675,
                788
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "h〔千岩老人〕南宋诗人萧德藻的自号。姜夔娶其侄女为妻，并跟他学诗。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                517,
                788,
                892,
                819
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "i〔黍离之悲〕指故国残破的悲思。《黍离》，《诗经·王风》中的一首诗。《毛诗序》称，周大夫见故都的宗庙宫室倾覆，遗址上长满了茂盛的黍子，于是写了《黍离》一诗表达自己的忧伤。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                517,
                819,
                892,
                884
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "a 选自《姜白石词笺注》卷一（中华书局2009 年版）。扬州慢，词牌名。姜夔（1155—1221），字尧章，号白石道人，饶州鄱阳（今属江西）人，南宋文学家、音乐家。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                94,
                755,
                468,
                819
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "c〔维扬〕扬州的别称。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                94,
                851,
                265,
                868
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "d〔初霁〕指雪方止，天刚晴。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                94,
                868,
                310,
                884
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "e〔荠麦〕野生麦子。一说，荠菜与麦子。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                94,
                884,
                384,
                901
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "b〔淳熙丙申至日〕宋孝宗淳熙三年（1176）冬至。至日，这里指冬至。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                94,
                819,
                467,
                851
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_number",
            "content": {
                "page_number_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "18"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                99,
                940,
                122,
                953
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footer",
            "content": {
                "page_footer_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "语文 选择性必修下册"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                136,
                939,
                292,
                954
            ]
        }
    ],
    [
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "j〔红药〕芍药花。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                531,
                884,
                672,
                902
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "淮左<sup>a</sup> 名都，竹西<sup>b</sup> 佳处，解鞍少驻<sup>c</sup> 初程。过春风十里<sup>d</sup>， 尽荠麦青青。自胡马窥江<sup>e</sup> 去后，废池乔木，犹厌言兵。渐黄昏， 清角<sup>f</sup> 吹寒，都在空城。 杜郎俊赏<sup>g</sup>，算而今，重到须惊。纵 豆蔻词工，青楼梦好，难赋深情<sup>h</sup>。二十四桥<sup>i</sup> 仍在，波心荡，冷 月无声。念桥边红药<sup>j</sup>，年年知为谁生？"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                105,
                68,
                702,
                181
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "image",
            "content": {
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/7501cd8af203402957a09839fd9d5af7759fa21e19e708bd3e66ca9f79352ea4.jpg"
                },
                "image_caption": [],
                "image_footnote": []
            },
            "bbox": [
                129,
                242,
                173,
                273
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "学习提示"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                186,
                247,
                292,
                269
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "这两首宋词都以城市为表现对象，一写承平盛世，一写劫后孤城，内容不同，意趣亦相异。《望海潮》开头总览杭州的优越位置和悠久历史，接着描绘此地风景的优美、市井的繁华以及人民生活的平和安乐。这首词采用铺叙的写法，以点带面，虚实相间，渲染烘托，形成一种畅达流利的气势。同样是歌咏城市，《扬州慢》则聚焦于扬州今昔盛衰的对比。词人一面描摹眼前景象，一面想象杜牧重游故地的震惊和悲哀，强化了兵火劫后的沉痛心情。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                144,
                285,
                862,
                417
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "柳永和姜夔都是深谙音律的词人，《望海潮》和《扬州慢》的词牌分别为二人首创，两首词作也极富声韵之美。诵读时要细加体会。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                146,
                420,
                862,
                463
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "使杜牧能极为工巧地描绘扬州的妙龄少女和青楼之梦，也难以表达对扬州遭劫的悲痛之情。杜牧诗《赠别》（其一）有“娉娉袅袅十三余，豆蔻梢头二月初”之语，《遣怀》有“十年一觉扬州梦，赢得青楼薄幸名”之语。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                552,
                740,
                904,
                820
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "i〔二十四桥〕指吴家砖桥，因古有二十四位美人吹箫于此，故名。一说，扬州在唐时极为富盛，著名的桥有二十四座，故名。杜牧诗《寄扬州韩绰判官》有“二十四桥明月夜，玉人何处教吹箫”之语。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                529,
                820,
                905,
                884
            ]
        },
        {
